OnePlus Pad 4 (Adreno 840) Mesa package: armada A8xx GL hang fix
Source:  https://github.com/armada-os/armada/pull/894 (merged 14 Nov 2026, head 1b42e4a9ba9a3093c0d9abb7b30022b681e7b2d0),
         packages/mesa/patches/0017-freedreno-a8xx-rb-done-ts-after-each-draw.patch
Author:  Armada contributors (Armada <armada@armadaos.dev>); tested by them on an AYN Odin 3 (Adreno 830)
Licence: MIT, the licence of the Mesa freedreno code it modifies (Armada LICENSE.md: "Modifications to bundled
         software are licensed under the terms of the software being modified"). Credit kept in the commit author.
Review:  not in Mesa upstream; no Mesa MR. A8xx only (CHIP >= A8XX); freedreno GL (gallium) only, not turnip.
Apply:   applies on staging/26.3 6cd33b7f68ee after the patches before it, without conflict or backport

From 9814cec5e521a24cdcbcf1deffe867ce9b6f8d05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armada <armada@armadaos.dev>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:40:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a8xx: emit an RB_DONE_TS event after each draw

On A830, GMEM rendering can hang the GPU, usually during bursts of small
blended draws. Sysmem rendering doesn't hang.

An RB_DONE_TS event that writes memory after each draw prevents it. A
CP_MEM_WRITE before each draw, the event without the write, the event
after every 8th draw, and a CCU_CLEAN_DEPTH after each draw don't.

Only A8xx gets the event, so other GPUs see no change.
---
 .../drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_context.h      |  3 +++
 .../drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_draw.cc        | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_context.h b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_context.h
index e27d81aa000..71b96cec3f0 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_context.h
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_context.h
@@ -161,6 +161,9 @@ struct fd6_control {
    } flush_base[4];
 
    uint32_t vsc_state[32];
+
+   /* written by the RB_DONE_TS event after each draw on A8xx: */
+   uint32_t draw_done;
 };
 
 #define control_ptr(fd6_ctx, member)                                           \
diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_draw.cc b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_draw.cc
index d9840c07962..1c375679b97 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_draw.cc
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a6xx/fd6_draw.cc
@@ -556,6 +556,26 @@ draw_vbos(struct fd_context *ctx, const struct pipe_draw_info *info,
 
    flush_streamout<CHIP>(ctx, cs, &emit);
 
+   /* On A830, GMEM rendering can hang the GPU, usually during bursts of
+    * small blended draws. An RB_DONE_TS event with a memory write after
+    * every draw prevents it; the write and the per-draw frequency are
+    * both needed.
+    */
+   if (CHIP >= A8XX) {
+      fd_pkt7(cs, CP_EVENT_WRITE7, 4)
+         .add(CP_EVENT_WRITE7_0(
+            .event = RB_DONE_TS,
+            .write_src = EV_WRITE_USER_32B,
+            .write_dst = EV_DST_RAM,
+            .write_enabled = true,
+         ))
+         .add(CP_EVENT_WRITE_ADDR(
+            .bo = fd6_ctx->control_mem,
+            .bo_offset = offsetof(struct fd6_control, draw_done),
+         ))
+         .add(ctx->batch->num_draws);
+   }
+
    fd_context_all_clean(ctx);
 }
 
